  "body": "Auction: 8-12 The Promenade, Takapuna on Wednesday 9 December 2026 at 9:30AM  (unless sold prior)\r\n\r\nSome homes are more than just a place to live – they are where memories are made, families grow and life is enjoyed.\r\n\r\nSituated in the highly sought-after suburb of Milford, this lovely home offers a wonderful combination of comfort, practicality and lifestyle convenience.\r\n\r\nThoughtfully arranged over two levels, the ground floor welcomes you with an open-plan living and dining area, a well-appointed kitchen and a spacious bedroom with semi-ensuite access. Sliding doors open from both the living area and bedroom onto a beautiful garden patio, creating a seamless indoor-outdoor connection – perfect for relaxing, entertaining or enjoying a quiet morning coffee.\r\n\r\nSet on a flat section, the property offers easy access and enjoyable outdoor living without the hassle of sloping grounds. An internal-access single garage, generous off-street parking and a separate laundry add further everyday convenience and practicality.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, you will find two comfortable double bedrooms, complemented by a family bathroom and a separate toilet, providing a practical and functional layout for the whole family.\r\n\r\nBuilt with a durable brick and cedar exterior, this home offers lasting appeal with relatively low maintenance – an ideal choice for busy families, first-home buyers and those seeking comfortable, easy-care living.\r\n\r\nLocation is everything, and Milford has so much to offer. Enjoy a short stroll to Milford Beach, leisurely walks around Lake Pupuke, and the convenience of Milford Shopping Centre with its boutique stores, cafés and everyday essentials.\r\n\r\nFamilies will appreciate the proximity to Milford School and the highly regarded Westlake Boys' and Westlake Girls' High Schools. North Shore Hospital is also nearby, while Takapuna is just minutes away, with convenient connections to Auckland CBD.\r\n\r\nWhether you are a growing family, a first-home buyer or looking for a comfortable home in a well-established neighbourhood, this is an opportunity worth exploring.\r\nWith vacant possession available, you can enjoy the flexibility of moving in and making this lovely home your own.\r\n\r\nOur motivated vendor is ready to sell, so don't miss this opportunity to secure a home in one of the North Shore's most desirable suburbs.\r\n\r\nCome and discover the warmth, convenience and lifestyle that Milford has to offer. Your next chapter starts here!",
